  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by reason of the poor quality of accommodation provided, would fail to deliver an acceptable standard of living conditions for future occupiers. In particular, the constrained relationship between the window of bedroom 2 and the windows of the communal kitchen/ dining area, would result in an unacceptable loss of outlook and privacy and would lead to substandard residential quality for future residents. The proposal is therefore incapable of meeting the reasonable needs of future occupiers, contrary to Section 12 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD5 and DMD8 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014).",
    "The proposed development, in the absence of adequate cycle storage and by virtue of its means of access, location and layout, would fail to provide a secure, convenient and high quality facility for all types of bicycles and would fail to promote or prioritise the use of sustainable modes of transport. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 9 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policies T1 and T5 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CP25 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010) and Poicy DMD45 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
  ],
